Firstmate

internal/setup is a Go port of the behaviour of Firstmate's bin/fm-remote-doctor.sh
(internal/setup/doctor.go) and bin/fm-install-herdr.sh (internal/setup/fetch.go,
internal/setup/builtin/herdr.toml), as of ndrwl/firstmate commit
2add138ffe92309787dbbedf375beb4f05704f7b, and of the wizard template Firstmate
uses, bin/wizard-template.sh and bin/wizard-template.ps1 in ndrwl/dev-setup at
commit 8a095ccfeff5563f776f743d088b44c5afc57747 (internal/setup/wizard.go,
internal/setup/term.go). See docs/decisions/setup-engine-from-firstmate.md,
which records the port and these revisions.

